[[File:Sea snake icon.png|left]]
'''Sea snake young''' are found in the [[Miscellania and Etceteria dungeon]], which can be entered during and after the [[Royal Trouble]] quest. A [[Slayer]] level of 40 is required to receive a [[Slayer task/Sea snakes|sea snakes]] Slayer task, but they can be killed at any level. The snakes are [[poison]]ous, with the poison starting at 7 damage. Players fighting them should bring poison protection of some sort, such as an [[antipoison]] or [[superantipoison]]. They attack with [[Melee]] and are vulnerable to [[Magic]], especially [[earth spells]]. Their unique drop is the [[water sapphire]], which is shared with the [[Sea Snake Hatchling|sea snake hatchling]].

Players can use the [[Eggs (Sea Snake)|blue eggs]] halfway through the tunnel as a [[safespot]]. A [[Dwarf multicannon]] can be used, but with reduced effectiveness due to the area being [[single-way combat]].

